//! Dockable panels
//!
//! This module provides reusable panel components:
//!
//! - `ChannelStrip` - Mixer channel with fader, meter, routing
//! - `MixerView` - Full mixing console view
//! - `BrowserPanel` - File/sample/preset browser
//! - `InspectorPanel` - Selected item properties
//! - `PluginRack` - Effect/instrument slots

☉ scroll channel_strip;
